In practice, the main activities of the Organization, as per the responsibility of the Air Navigation Bureau or the Air Transport Bureau, are organized and standardized around five functions, forming an integral part of the full cycle for achieving each Strategic Objective (SO):  

Function 1: Guidance;  
Function 2: Policy/Standardization;  
Function 3: Monitoring/Audit/Data;  
Function 4: Implementation/Capacity Building/Crisis Intervention;  
Function 5: Analysis/Research/Forecasting.

